{%- comment -%}
  Cart drawer (copy of the Metabolae "Your order" drawer, in your brand red).
  INSTALL: replace the WHOLE content of snippets/cart-drawer.liquid with this file. Also replace the two files in assets/
  (component-cart-drawer-custom.css and cart-drawer-custom.js) with their new versions. sections/cart-drawer.liquid stays as it is.
  In the theme settings, Cart > Cart type must be "Drawer".

  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW (everything between the two long lines of "=" is yours to change).
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Do not type three | in a row inside a line except as the separators.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ================================ EDIT FROM HERE ================================ {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_title = 'Your order' -%}
{%- assign mcd_empty_title = 'Your cart is empty' -%}
{%- assign mcd_empty_sub = 'Our Buy 2 Get 1 FREE bundle is the most popular.' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Colours. mcd_brand = your red (buttons, badges, stars, borders). mcd_brand_dark = the buttons on hover.
  mcd_brand_ink = the darker red of small red text. mcd_tint = background of the upgrade card, mcd_tint_2 = background of the guarantee box.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_brand = '#913939' -%}
{%- assign mcd_brand_dark = '#7a3131' -%}
{%- assign mcd_brand_ink = '#6c2a2a' -%}
{%- assign mcd_tint = '#fdf0f0' -%}
{%- assign mcd_tint_2 = '#fdf2f2' -%}

{%- comment -%} Under each product: star rating line and 3 tick lines. Set mcd_show_facts to false to hide both. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_show_facts = true -%}
{%- assign mcd_rating = '4.9' -%}
{%- assign mcd_rating_text = 'Thousands of 5-star reviews' -%}
{%- capture mcd_facts_data -%}
<strong>Berberine HCl</strong>, the stable, bioavailable form, not standard powder
@@
<strong>500mg therapeutic dose</strong> with black pepper extract for better absorption
@@
Supports <strong>healthy blood sugar</strong>, metabolism and hormonal balance
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Your bundles. One row = a word in the variant name ||| packs in the bundle ||| packs the customer pays for.
  Put @@ on its own line between rows. Anything not listed counts as 1 pack.
  The biggest bundle is the best deal: once a product reaches it, the green "Best price per pack unlocked" message shows.
  If your bundles are not separate variants (one product added with a quantity, like Kaching quantity bundles), the pack numbers
  (1, 3, 5) are the steps of the - / + box and the third number is used to work out the upgrade price.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture mcd_pack_data -%}
Buy 1 ||| 1 ||| 1
@@
Buy 2 Get 1 ||| 3 ||| 2
@@
Buy 3 Get 2 ||| 5 ||| 3
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mcd_per_label = 'per pack' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The "- 3 +" box under each product.
  Bundles that are variants: - / + move the customer to the bundle below / above. Selling plans are carried over.
  Bundles that are not: mcd_qty_jump = true makes - / + jump between the bundle sizes of the list above (1, 3, 5), like Metabolae.
  false = one pack at a time. mcd_qty_stepper = false hides the box on those products.
  mcd_fold_free = true counts the free packs of a product (the free one in Buy 2 Get 1) inside its paid line, so the customer
  sees one line with 3 packs, like Metabolae. false = the free packs show as their own FREE line.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_qty_stepper = true -%}
{%- assign mcd_qty_jump = true -%}
{%- assign mcd_fold_free = true -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The green message once a product reaches your biggest bundle. [savings] is replaced by the bundle savings of the whole order.
  The second text shows instead while the offer card further down is switched on.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_maxtier_a = 'Best price per pack unlocked — [savings] off this order, free shipping included.' -%}
{%- assign mcd_maxtier_bc = 'Best deal unlocked — [savings] off this order, free shipping included.' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The "BEST VALUE" upgrade card under the product. It shows until the biggest bundle is in the cart, and its button moves the customer up to it.
  [save] = saving per pack, [packs] = packs added, [price] = what those packs cost, [each] = price per pack of the biggest bundle. All are worked out for you.
  mcd_upg_image = picture link of your biggest bundle (Metabolae shows 5 pouches side by side, 112 x 84 px). Empty = the product photo.
  mcd_upg_ship_icon = picture link of the small truck. Empty = a built-in truck in your brand colour.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_show = true -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_image = '' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_ship_icon = '' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_pill = 'Best value' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_save = 'Save [save] per pack' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_head = '+[packs] packs for [price] — [each] each' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_sub = 'Free shipping included.' -%}
{%- assign mcd_upg_btn = 'Upgrade' -%}

{%- comment -%} Money-back guarantee box. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_g_show = true -%}
{%- assign mcd_g_days = '60' -%}
{%- assign mcd_g_title = '60-Day Money Back Guarantee' -%}
{%- assign mcd_g_bold = 'Less than 1%' -%}
{%- assign mcd_g_rest = ' of customers ever claim it.' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Four small trust boxes. One box = picture link ||| text (use <br> for a line break). Leave the picture link empty for a built-in icon.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_chips_show = true -%}
{%- capture mcd_chips_data -%}
 ||| Berberine HCl,<br>not powder
@@
 ||| 500mg<br>therapeutic dose
@@
 ||| Black pepper<br>absorption
@@
 ||| Third-party<br>lab verified
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign mcd_checkout = 'Secure checkout' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Payment icons under the button. Empty mcd_pay_types = the first mcd_pay_limit icons of the list of your own store (what Metabolae does).
  To choose and order them yourself, list the names with commas, e.g. visa,master,american_express,apple_pay,google_pay,paypal,shopify_pay
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_pay_limit = 5 -%}
{%- assign mcd_pay_types = '' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  OPTIONAL one-click offer card (like "Try Vitamin D3 + K2"). Leave mcd_up_variant at 0 to switch it off.
  mcd_up_variant = the variant ID of the product you offer. mcd_up_plan = its selling plan ID (0 if it is a one-time product).
  The card hides itself once that product is in the cart. While it shows, it takes the place of the upgrade card (as on Metabolae).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_variant = 0 -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_plan = 0 -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_band = 'Free shipping included' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_image = '' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_pill = 'Best value' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_save = 'Save $30 per pack' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_head = 'Try this product for $29.99' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_claim = '<strong>93% of customers</strong> claimed this offer' -%}
{%- assign mcd_up_btn = 'Upgrade' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  OPTIONAL shipping protection switch. Leave mcd_sp_variant at 0 to switch it off.
  mcd_sp_variant = the variant ID of your shipping protection product. mcd_sp_plan = its selling plan ID (0 if none).
  NOTE: like the original, once this is switched on the script adds the protection to the cart by itself and the customer can turn it off.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mcd_sp_variant = 0 -%}
{%- assign mcd_sp_plan = 0 -%}
{%- assign mcd_sp_title = 'Shipping Protection ($3.95)' -%}
{%- assign mcd_sp_sub = 'Covered against loss, theft, or damage' -%}
{%- assign mcd_sp_icon = '' -%}
{%- comment -%} ================================ EDIT UNTIL HERE ================================ {%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign mcd_facts = mcd_facts_data | split: '@@'
  assign mcd_pack_rows = mcd_pack_data | split: '@@'
  assign mcd_chips = mcd_chips_data | split: '@@'

  assign mcd_max_packs = 1
  assign mcd_top_paid = 0
  for prow in mcd_pack_rows
    assign pf = prow | split: '|||'
    assign pn = pf[1] | strip | plus: 0
    if pn > mcd_max_packs
      assign mcd_max_packs = pn
      assign mcd_top_paid = pf[2] | strip | plus: 0
    endif
  endfor
  if mcd_top_paid < 1 or mcd_top_paid > mcd_max_packs
    assign mcd_top_paid = mcd_max_packs
  endif

  assign mcd_pk_csv = ''
  assign mcd_mt_csv = ''
  for item in cart.items
    assign packs = 1
    assign pm = 'n'
    assign vt = item.variant.title | downcase
    for prow in mcd_pack_rows
      assign pf = prow | split: '|||'
      assign pkey = pf[0] | strip | downcase
      if pkey != blank and vt contains pkey
        assign packs = pf[1] | strip | plus: 0
        assign pm = 'y'
      endif
    endfor
    if packs < 1
      assign packs = 1
    endif
    assign mcd_pk_csv = mcd_pk_csv | append: packs | append: ','
    assign mcd_mt_csv = mcd_mt_csv | append: pm | append: ','
  endfor
  assign mcd_pk = mcd_pk_csv | split: ','
  assign mcd_mt = mcd_mt_csv | split: ','

  assign mcd_lines = 0
  assign mcd_savings = 0
  assign mcd_sp_key = ''
  assign mcd_up_in_cart = false
  assign mcd_is_max = false
  for item in cart.items
    if mcd_sp_variant > 0 and item.variant_id == mcd_sp_variant
      assign mcd_sp_key = item.key
      continue
    endif
    assign mcd_lines = mcd_lines | plus: 1
    if mcd_up_variant > 0 and item.variant_id == mcd_up_variant
      assign mcd_up_in_cart = true
    endif
    assign cu = item.variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
    if cu < item.original_price
      assign cu = item.original_price
    endif
    assign cl = cu | times: item.quantity
    assign ls = cl | minus: item.final_line_price
    if ls > 0
      assign mcd_savings = mcd_savings | plus: ls
    endif
    if item.final_line_price > 0 and item.variant_id != mcd_up_variant and mcd_max_packs > 1
      assign tot = 0
      for other in cart.items
        if other.product_id == item.product_id
          assign op = mcd_pk[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
          assign tot = op | times: other.quantity | plus: tot
        endif
      endfor
      if tot >= mcd_max_packs
        assign mcd_is_max = true
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  assign mcd_is_empty = false
  if mcd_lines == 0
    assign mcd_is_empty = true
  endif
  assign mcd_show_up = false
  if mcd_up_variant > 0 and mcd_lines > 0 and mcd_up_in_cart == false
    assign mcd_show_up = true
  endif
  assign mcd_show_sp = false
  if mcd_sp_variant > 0 and mcd_lines > 0
    assign mcd_show_sp = true
  endif
-%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap"></noscript>
<script src="{{ 'cart.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'component-cart-drawer-custom.css' | asset_url }}" media="all">
<script src="{{ 'cart-drawer-custom.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<style>
  .drawer {
    visibility: hidden;
  }
  .mcd-shell.mcd-sp-on .fc-sp-block{display:flex}
  .mcd-shell .drawer__inner-empty{position:relative}
  .mcd-shell .drawer__inner-empty .drawer__close{position:absolute;top:8px;right:12px;margin:0}
</style>

<cart-drawer class="drawer{% if mcd_is_empty %} is-empty{% endif %}">
  <div id="CartDrawer" class="cart-drawer">
    <div id="CartDrawer-Overlay" class="cart-drawer__overlay"></div>
    <div
      class="drawer__inner mcd-shell{% if mcd_is_empty %} is-empty{% endif %}{% if mcd_show_up %} fc-force-b{% endif %}{% if mcd_show_sp %} mcd-sp-on{% endif %}"
      style="--mcd-brand:{{ mcd_brand }};--mcd-brand-dark:{{ mcd_brand_dark }};--mcd-brand-ink:{{ mcd_brand_ink }};--mcd-warm-bg:{{ mcd_tint }};--mcd-warm-bg-2:{{ mcd_tint_2 }}"
      {% if mcd_lines == 0 and mcd_sp_key != blank %}data-fc-sp-only="{{ mcd_sp_key }}"{% endif %}
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-label="Your cart"
      tabindex="-1"
    >
      {%- if mcd_is_empty -%}
        <div class="drawer__inner-empty">
          <button
            class="drawer__close"
            type="button"
            onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()"
            aria-label="Close"
          >
            <span class="svg-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon icon-close" viewBox="0 0 18 17"><path fill="currentColor" d="M.865 15.978a.5.5 0 0 0 .707.707l7.433-7.431 7.579 7.282a.501.501 0 0 0 .846-.37.5.5 0 0 0-.153-.351L9.712 8.546l7.417-7.416a.5.5 0 1 0-.707-.708L8.991 7.853 1.413.573a.5.5 0 1 0-.693.72l7.563 7.268z"></path></svg></span>
          </button>
          <p class="mcd-empty-title">{{ mcd_empty_title }}</p>
          <p class="mcd-empty-sub">{{ mcd_empty_sub }}</p>
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="mcd-head">
          <h2 class="mcd-title">{{ mcd_title }}</h2>
          <button class="drawer__close" type="button" onclick="this.closest('cart-drawer').close()" aria-label="Close">
            <span class="svg-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon icon-close" viewBox="0 0 18 17"><path fill="currentColor" d="M.865 15.978a.5.5 0 0 0 .707.707l7.433-7.431 7.579 7.282a.501.501 0 0 0 .846-.37.5.5 0 0 0-.153-.351L9.712 8.546l7.417-7.416a.5.5 0 1 0-.707-.708L8.991 7.853 1.413.573a.5.5 0 1 0-.693.72l7.563 7.268z"></path></svg></span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="mcd-body">
          <p class="mcd-err" hidden role="alert"></p>

          {%- assign mcd_upg_html = '' -%}
          <div class="mcd-lines">
            {%- for item in cart.items -%}
              {%- if mcd_sp_variant > 0 and item.variant_id == mcd_sp_variant -%}
                {%- continue -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign li = forloop.index0
                assign is_paid = false
                if item.final_line_price > 0
                  assign is_paid = true
                endif
                assign folded = false
                assign host = false
                if mcd_fold_free
                  if is_paid
                    assign host = true
                    for other in cart.items
                      if forloop.index0 >= li
                        break
                      endif
                      if other.product_id == item.product_id and other.final_line_price > 0
                        assign host = false
                      endif
                    endfor
                  else
                    for other in cart.items
                      if other.product_id == item.product_id and other.final_line_price > 0
                        assign folded = true
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                  endif
                endif
              -%}
              {%- if folded -%}
                {%- continue -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign own_packs = mcd_pk[li] | plus: 0
                assign line_match = false
                if mcd_mt[li] == 'y'
                  assign line_match = true
                endif
                assign cu = item.variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
                if cu < item.original_price
                  assign cu = item.original_price
                endif
                assign cl = cu | times: item.quantity
                assign fl = item.final_line_price
                assign line_packs = own_packs | times: item.quantity
                assign also_keys = ''
                if host
                  for other in cart.items
                    if other.product_id == item.product_id and other.final_line_price == 0
                      assign op = mcd_pk[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
                      assign line_packs = op | times: other.quantity | plus: line_packs
                      assign ocu = other.variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
                      if ocu < other.original_price
                        assign ocu = other.original_price
                      endif
                      assign cl = ocu | times: other.quantity | plus: cl
                      if other.key != item.key
                        unless also_keys contains other.key
                          assign also_keys = also_keys | append: other.key | append: ','
                        endunless
                      endif
                    endif
                  endfor
                endif
                assign ls = cl | minus: fl
                assign pct = 0
                if ls > 0 and cl > 0
                  assign pct = ls | times: 100.0 | divided_by: cl | floor
                endif
                assign per_pack = fl | times: 1.0 | divided_by: line_packs | round

                assign line_plan = ''
                if item.selling_plan_allocation
                  assign line_plan = item.selling_plan_allocation.selling_plan.id
                endif
                assign step_mode = ''
                if is_paid and item.variant_id != mcd_up_variant
                  if line_match
                    assign step_mode = 'tier'
                  elsif mcd_qty_stepper
                    assign step_mode = 'qty'
                  endif
                endif

                assign down_id = 0
                assign down_packs = 0
                assign up_id = 0
                assign up_packs = 100000
                assign top_id = 0
                assign top_packs = 0
                assign top_price = 0
                assign top_img = nil
                if step_mode == 'tier'
                  for pv in item.product.variants
                    if pv.available == false
                      continue
                    endif
                    assign pvt = pv.title | downcase
                    assign vp = 0
                    for prow in mcd_pack_rows
                      assign pf = prow | split: '|||'
                      assign pkey = pf[0] | strip | downcase
                      if pkey != blank and pvt contains pkey
                        assign vp = pf[1] | strip | plus: 0
                      endif
                    endfor
                    if vp > 0 and vp < own_packs and vp > down_packs
                      assign down_id = pv.id
                      assign down_packs = vp
                    endif
                    if vp > own_packs and vp < up_packs
                      assign up_id = pv.id
                      assign up_packs = vp
                    endif
                    if vp > own_packs and vp > top_packs
                      assign top_id = pv.id
                      assign top_packs = vp
                      assign top_price = pv.price
                      if line_plan != ''
                        for alloc in pv.selling_plan_allocations
                          if alloc.selling_plan.id == line_plan
                            assign top_price = alloc.price
                          endif
                        endfor
                      endif
                      assign top_img = pv.featured_image
                    endif
                  endfor
                endif

                assign step_cur = line_packs
                assign q_down = 0
                assign q_up = 0
                if step_mode == 'qty'
                  if host == false
                    assign step_cur = 0
                    for other in cart.items
                      if other.key == item.key
                        assign step_cur = step_cur | plus: other.quantity
                      endif
                    endfor
                  endif
                  if mcd_qty_jump
                    assign q_up = 100000
                    for prow in mcd_pack_rows
                      assign pf = prow | split: '|||'
                      assign pn = pf[1] | strip | plus: 0
                      if pn > 0 and pn < step_cur and pn > q_down
                        assign q_down = pn
                      endif
                      if pn > step_cur and pn < q_up
                        assign q_up = pn
                      endif
                    endfor
                    if q_up == 100000
                      assign q_up = 0
                    endif
                  else
                    assign q_down = step_cur | minus: 1
                    assign q_up = step_cur | plus: 1
                  endif
                endif

                assign upg = false
                if mcd_upg_show and mcd_is_max == false and mcd_upg_html == ''
                  if step_mode == 'tier' and top_id != 0
                    assign u_price = top_price
                    assign u_packs = top_packs
                    assign u_add = top_packs | minus: line_packs
                    assign upg = true
                  elsif step_mode == 'qty' and mcd_max_packs > step_cur
                    assign u_price = fl | times: 1.0 | divided_by: item.quantity | times: mcd_top_paid | round
                    assign u_packs = mcd_max_packs
                    assign u_add = mcd_max_packs | minus: step_cur
                    assign upg = true
                  endif
                endif
                if upg
                  assign u_add_price = u_price | minus: fl
                  assign u_each = u_price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: u_packs | round
                  assign u_save = per_pack | minus: u_each
                  if u_add < 1 or u_add_price <= 0 or u_save <= 0
                    assign upg = false
                  endif
                endif

                assign line_facts = false
                if mcd_show_facts and item.variant_id != mcd_up_variant
                  assign line_facts = true
                endif
              -%}
              <div class="mcd-line" data-key="{{ item.key }}">
                <div class="mcd-media">
                  {%- if item.image -%}<img class="mcd-thumb" src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 156 }}" alt="" width="78" height="80" decoding="async">{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if fl == 0 -%}<span class="mcd-save-badge">FREE</span>{%- elsif pct > 0 -%}<span class="mcd-save-badge">−{{ pct }}%</span>{%- endif -%}
                </div>

                <div class="mcd-line-main">
                  <p class="mcd-line-name">{{ item.product.title | escape }}</p>
                  {%- if line_facts -%}
                    <div class="mcd-rating">
                      <span class="mcd-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
                      <span class="mcd-rating-text"><strong>{{ mcd_rating }}</strong> · {{ mcd_rating_text }}</span>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="mcd-facts">
                      {%- for fact in mcd_facts -%}
                        <li><p>{{ fact | strip }}</p></li>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </ul>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <div class="mcd-controls">
                    <div class="mcd-controls-left">
                      {%- if step_mode == 'tier' -%}
                        <div class="mcd-stepper" role="group" aria-label="Bundle size in packs">
                          {%- if down_id != 0 -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="Fewer packs" data-mcd-tier data-dir="down" data-fc-bundle-main data-to="{{ down_id }}" data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-plan="{{ line_plan }}">−</button>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="Fewer packs" data-mcd-tier data-dir="down" data-fc-bundle-main disabled>−</button>
                          {%- endif -%}
                          <span class="mcd-qty">{{ line_packs }}</span>
                          {%- if up_id != 0 -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="More packs" data-mcd-tier data-dir="up" data-fc-bundle-main data-to="{{ up_id }}" data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-plan="{{ line_plan }}">+</button>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="More packs" data-mcd-tier data-dir="up" data-fc-bundle-main disabled>+</button>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      {%- elsif step_mode == 'qty' -%}
                        <div class="mcd-stepper" role="group" aria-label="Bundle size in packs">
                          {%- if q_down > 0 -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="Fewer packs" data-fc-qty data-dir="down" data-fc-bundle-main data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-qty="{{ q_down }}"{% if also_keys != '' %} data-also="{{ also_keys }}"{% endif %}>−</button>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="Fewer packs" data-fc-qty data-dir="down" data-fc-bundle-main disabled>−</button>
                          {%- endif -%}
                          <span class="mcd-qty">{{ step_cur }}</span>
                          {%- if q_up > 0 -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="More packs" data-fc-qty data-dir="up" data-fc-bundle-main data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-qty="{{ q_up }}"{% if also_keys != '' %} data-also="{{ also_keys }}"{% endif %}>+</button>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <button class="mcd-step" type="button" aria-label="More packs" data-fc-qty data-dir="up" data-fc-bundle-main disabled>+</button>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <button class="mcd-remove" type="button" data-mcd-remove data-key="{{ item.key }}"{% if also_keys != '' %} data-also="{{ also_keys }}"{% endif %}{% if step_mode != '' %} data-fc-bundle-main{% endif %}>Remove</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mcd-prices"><div class="mcd-per-unit">{% if fl == 0 %}Free{% else %}{{ per_pack | money }} {{ mcd_per_label }}{% endif %}</div></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              {%- if upg -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign u_save_m = u_save | money
                  assign u_add_price_m = u_add_price | money
                  assign u_each_m = u_each | money
                  assign u_save_txt = mcd_upg_save | replace: '[save]', u_save_m
                  assign u_head_txt = mcd_upg_head | replace: '[packs]', u_add | replace: '[price]', u_add_price_m | replace: '[each]', u_each_m
                -%}
                {%- capture mcd_upg_html -%}
                  <div class="mcd-upgrade">
                    {%- if mcd_upg_image != blank -%}
                      <img class="mcd-upgrade-img" src="{{ mcd_upg_image }}" alt="" width="56" height="42" decoding="async">
                    {%- elsif top_img -%}
                      <img class="mcd-upgrade-img" src="{{ top_img | image_url: width: 112 }}" alt="" width="56" height="42" decoding="async">
                    {%- elsif item.image -%}
                      <img class="mcd-upgrade-img" src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 112 }}" alt="" width="56" height="42" decoding="async">
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <div class="mcd-upgrade-main">
                      <div class="mcd-upgrade-tags">
                        <span class="mcd-pill">{{ mcd_upg_pill }}</span>
                        <span class="mcd-upgrade-save">{{ u_save_txt }}</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="mcd-upgrade-head">{{ u_head_txt }}</p>
                      <p class="mcd-upgrade-sub">
                        {%- if mcd_upg_ship_icon != blank -%}
                          <img class="mcd-ship-icon" src="{{ mcd_upg_ship_icon }}" alt="" width="40" height="22" decoding="async">
                        {%- else -%}
                          <svg class="mcd-ship-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 22" width="40" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.5 8.5h6M3 11h4.5M1.5 13.5h6"></path><rect x="9" y="3.5" width="17" height="12.5" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M26 7.5h5.4l3.6 4.4V16h-9"></path><path d="M28 9.5h2.6l1.9 2.4H28z"></path><rect x="11.5" y="6.8" width="12" height="5.6" rx="2.8"></rect><text x="17.5" y="11.1" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Poppins,sans-serif" font-size="3.8" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">FREE</text><circle cx="14.5" cy="17.6" r="2.4" class="mcd-ship-wheel"></circle><circle cx="30.5" cy="17.6" r="2.4" class="mcd-ship-wheel"></circle></svg>
                        {%- endif -%}
                        <span>{{ mcd_upg_sub }}</span>
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    {%- if step_mode == 'tier' -%}
                      <button class="mcd-upgrade-btn" type="button" data-mcd-tier data-dir="upgrade" data-fc-bundle-main data-to="{{ top_id }}" data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-plan="{{ line_plan }}">{{ mcd_upg_btn }}</button>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <button class="mcd-upgrade-btn" type="button" data-fc-qty data-dir="upgrade" data-fc-bundle-main data-key="{{ item.key }}" data-qty="{{ mcd_max_packs }}"{% if also_keys != '' %} data-also="{{ also_keys }}"{% endif %}>{{ mcd_upg_btn }}</button>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>
                {%- endcapture -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>

          {%- if mcd_is_max -%}
            {%- assign mcd_sav_money = mcd_savings | money -%}
            <div class="mcd-maxtier">
              <p>
                <span class="fc-maxtier-a">{{ mcd_maxtier_a | replace: '[savings]', mcd_sav_money }}</span>
                <span class="fc-maxtier-bc">{{ mcd_maxtier_bc | replace: '[savings]', mcd_sav_money }}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          {%- elsif mcd_upg_html != '' -%}
            {{ mcd_upg_html }}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if mcd_show_up -%}
            <div class="fc-upsell-card fc-upsell-card--b">
              <div class="fc-upsell-card__band">
                <svg class="fc-upsell-card__truck" viewBox="0 0 24 16" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M1.5 2h12v10h-12z"></path>
                  <path d="M13.5 5h4.2l3 3.2V12h-7.2"></path>
                  <circle cx="6" cy="13" r="1.8"></circle>
                  <circle cx="17.5" cy="13" r="1.8"></circle>
                </svg>
                <span>{{ mcd_up_band }}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="fc-upsell-card__body">
                {%- if mcd_up_image != blank -%}<img class="fc-upsell-card__img" src="{{ mcd_up_image }}" alt="" width="84" height="84" decoding="async">{%- endif -%}
                <div class="fc-upsell-card__main">
                  <div class="fc-upsell-card__tags">
                    <span class="fc-upsell-card__pill">{{ mcd_up_pill }}</span>
                    <span class="fc-upsell-card__save">{{ mcd_up_save }}</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="fc-upsell-card__head">{{ mcd_up_head }}</p>
                  <p class="fc-upsell-card__claim">{{ mcd_up_claim }}</p>
                </div>
                <button class="fc-upsell-card__btn" type="button" data-fc-upsell-add data-fc-items="[{&quot;id&quot;:{{ mcd_up_variant }},&quot;quantity&quot;:1{% if mcd_up_plan > 0 %},&quot;selling_plan&quot;:{{ mcd_up_plan }}{% endif %}}]">{{ mcd_up_btn }}</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if mcd_g_show -%}
            <div class="mcd-guarantee">
              <svg class="mcd-guarantee-badge" viewBox="0 0 46 46" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="23" cy="23" r="21" fill="#fff" stroke="{{ mcd_brand }}" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
                <circle cx="23" cy="23" r="17" fill="none" stroke="{{ mcd_brand }}" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="2 2.4"></circle>
                <text x="23" y="21" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Poppins,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="{{ mcd_brand_ink }}">{{ mcd_g_days }}</text>
                <text x="23" y="31" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Poppins,sans-serif" font-size="6.5" font-weight="700" letter-spacing=".5" fill="{{ mcd_brand_ink }}">DAYS</text>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="mcd-guarantee-title">{{ mcd_g_title }}</p>
                <p class="mcd-guarantee-sub"><strong>{{ mcd_g_bold }}</strong>{{ mcd_g_rest }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if mcd_chips_show -%}
            <ul class="mcd-trust">
              {%- for chip in mcd_chips -%}
                {%- assign cf = chip | split: '|||' -%}
                {%- assign cimg = cf[0] | strip -%}
                <li>
                  {%- if cimg != blank -%}
                    <img class="mcd-chip-img" src="{{ cimg }}" alt="" width="36" height="36" decoding="async">
                  {%- else -%}
                    <svg class="mcd-chip-img" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" stroke="{{ mcd_brand_ink }}" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                      {%- case forloop.index -%}
                        {%- when 1 -%}<path d="M18 8l8 3v6c0 5-3.4 8.4-8 10-4.6-1.6-8-5-8-10v-6z"></path><path d="M14.5 17.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"></path>
                        {%- when 2 -%}<rect x="8" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="4" transform="rotate(-35 18 18)"></rect><path d="M14.5 21.5l7-7"></path>
                        {%- when 3 -%}<path d="M18 8.5c3.6 4.2 6 7 6 10a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-3 2.4-5.8 6-10z"></path>
                        {%- else -%}<path d="M15 8.5h6M16 8.5v6.5l-5 9a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.3 2.2h11.4a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.3-2.2l-5-9V8.5"></path><path d="M13.5 21h9"></path>
                      {%- endcase -%}
                    </svg>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <span>{{ cf[1] | strip }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="mcd-foot">
          <div class="mcd-sum-row mcd-row-subtotal">
            <span>Subtotal</span>
            <span>{{ cart.total_price | plus: mcd_savings | money }}</span>
          </div>
          {%- if mcd_savings > 0 -%}
            <div class="mcd-sum-row is-savings mcd-row-savings">
              <span>Bundle savings</span>
              <span>−{{ mcd_savings | money }}</span>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="mcd-total-row">
            <span class="mcd-total-label">Total</span>
            <span class="mcd-total-val">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
          </div>

          {%- if mcd_show_sp -%}
            <div class="fc-sp-block" data-fc-sp-variant="{{ mcd_sp_variant }}"{% if mcd_sp_plan > 0 %} data-fc-sp-plan="{{ mcd_sp_plan }}"{% endif %} data-fc-sp-incart="{% if mcd_sp_key != blank %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"{% if mcd_sp_key != blank %} data-fc-sp-key="{{ mcd_sp_key }}"{% endif %}>
              <div class="fc-sp-block__info">
                {%- if mcd_sp_icon != blank -%}
                  <img class="fc-sp-block__icon" src="{{ mcd_sp_icon }}" alt="" width="38" height="43" decoding="async">
                {%- else -%}
                  <svg class="fc-sp-block__icon" viewBox="0 0 38 43" fill="none" stroke="{{ mcd_brand_ink }}" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 4l14 5.5V21c0 9-6 15.5-14 18C11 36.500 5 30 5 21V9.500z"></path><path d="M13 21.500l4.500 4.500L26 17"></path></svg>
                {%- endif -%}
                <div class="fc-sp-block__text">
                  <p class="fc-sp-block__title">{{ mcd_sp_title }}</p>
                  <p class="fc-sp-block__sub">{{ mcd_sp_sub }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <button class="fc-sp-toggle" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Shipping protection" data-fc-sp-toggle>
                <span class="fc-sp-toggle__knob"></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" id="CartDrawer-Form" novalidate>
            <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="mcd-cta">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="4" y="9" width="12" height="8" rx="1.6"></rect>
                <path d="M7 9V6.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V9" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="mcd-cta-label">{{ mcd_checkout }} · {{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
            </button>
          </form>

          {%- liquid
            assign mcd_pay_html = ''
            assign mcd_pay_count = 0
            if mcd_pay_types != blank
              assign mcd_pay_order = mcd_pay_types | remove: ' ' | split: ','
              for ptype in mcd_pay_order
                if shop.enabled_payment_types contains ptype and mcd_pay_count < mcd_pay_limit
                  assign one_svg = ptype | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'icon icon--full-color'
                  assign mcd_pay_html = mcd_pay_html | append: one_svg
                  assign mcd_pay_count = mcd_pay_count | plus: 1
                endif
              endfor
            else
              for ptype in shop.enabled_payment_types limit: mcd_pay_limit
                assign one_svg = ptype | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'icon icon--full-color'
                assign mcd_pay_html = mcd_pay_html | append: one_svg
                assign mcd_pay_count = mcd_pay_count | plus: 1
              endfor
            endif
          -%}
          {%- if mcd_pay_count > 0 -%}
            <div class="mcd-pay">{{ mcd_pay_html }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</cart-drawer>
